      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "The aspose-words-foss package exposes aspose.words_foss.Document as the primary entry point for loading and saving documents, and aspose.words_foss.light_document_model as a lightweight representation for inspection and transformation. The Document class supports loading from DOC, DOCX, RTF, TEXT, and MARKDOWN formats via LoadFormat, and saving to DOCX, PDF, MARKDOWN, and TEXT via SaveFormat.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.document",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.light_document_model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.document",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.Document class loads documents from file paths, streams, or bytes and populates the Light Document Model immediately at construction time, exposing properties such as sections, first_section, last_section, styles, lists, page_count, and methods like get_text() and save() with SaveFormat or save options.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.document",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.loadformat",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.saveformat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.docx_reader",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.docx_reader module provides the DocumentReader class that implements the DocumentFormatReader protocol, offering load_file(), load_stream(), and load_bytes() methods followed by to_light_document() to produce a structured Light Document Model from DOCX input.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.docx_reader",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.docx_writer",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.light_document_model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.pdf_writer",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.pdf_writer module, backed by the fpdf2>=2.7.5 dependency, exposes saving options through aspose.words_foss.saving.PdfSaveOptions that control PDF output quality and rendering behavior when calling Document.save() with SaveFormat.PDF.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "dependency:fpdf2-2.7.5",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.pdf_writer",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.saving"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.markdownloadoptions",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.MarkdownLoadOptions class, part of the aspose.words_foss.saving module, configures how Markdown files are loaded, and the aspose.words_foss.md_writer module provides MarkdownSaveOptions for controlling export behavior when saving to .md via Document.save().",
      "fact_ids": [
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.markdownloadoptions",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.md_writer",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.saving"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.light_document_model",
      "text": "The aspose.words_foss.light_document_model module provides a lightweight representation of a document's structure, with the aspose.words_foss.model module exposing types like Document and Paragraph that expose properties such as all_paragraphs, tables, text, styles, and lists for inspection and transformation.",
      "fact_ids": [
        "dependency:pydantic-2.0.0",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.light_document_model",
        "public_symbol:aspose.words_foss.model"
      ]
    }
  ],
